            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
            
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/60 transition bg-blue-50/30">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900">光速云 (GuangSu Cloud)</td><td class="p-3.5 ">企业级 IEPL/IPLC 物理专线</td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">99.9% (全天候稳定)</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">35ms – 48ms</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">&lt; 0.2%</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">极高 (专线不经公网)</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 rounded font-bold">强烈推荐 (红榜首推) ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️</span></td>
            </tr>
            
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/60 transition ">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900">暮光加速 (MuGuang)</td><td class="p-3.5 ">BGP 智能调度专线</td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="text-emerald-600 font-semibold">98.5%</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="font-mono text-emerald-600 font-semibold">42ms – 60ms</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="font-mono text-emerald-600">&lt; 0.5%</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="text-emerald-600">高 (自动故障转移)</span></td><td class="p-3.5 "><span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded font-medium">推荐 (红榜) ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️</span></td>
            </tr>
            
